      "created_at": "2018-07-31T12:26:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I actually ended up having a pretty good match.</p>\n<p>Really satisfying ending in which Ambuscade was down to 1 HP and pulled out his Cloaking Device (for the 4th time) it would have bought him some time but Benchmark used Threat Neutralizer… bye bye Ambuscade. I actually don’t know if I ever beat Ambuscade on his flipped side before.</p>",
