      "created_at": "2018-07-31T12:27:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Could be a hint for unlocks?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>At any rate, the heroes had their way with Ansel. Final round had an 8 card fueled Haka of Battle Taiaha strike, a triple Raptor Bot swarm, and a 6 card fueled Omni Cannon blast. Ouch.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Haka 20HP, Unity 15HP, Bunker 18HP, and Benchmark 20HP.</p>",
