      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2018-07-31T14:16:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Easy Mint.&nbsp; Unity spent the first two turns double-skipping, as her first 6 cards were: 1 Scrap Metal and 5 bots.&nbsp; She started building up while Ambuscade was flipped, and then when Haka ate the Cloaking device with Savage Mana, (Nom), her bots and bunker's External Combustion took out everything else.&nbsp; Benchmark was somewhat useful, but didn't get much in the way of setup cards other than the Hardware seeker.</p>",
